    (description) Bandle is a daily music guessing game: name the song one instrument at a time, with each wrong guess layering in another (drums, bass, guitar, piano) across up to six clues. A smart, replayable Wordle/Heardle-style puzzle — but only the latest songs are free, with the back catalogue and themed packs paywalled, which knocks it down a notch.

