    (description) Kingdoms of Amalur: Reckoning is a single-player action role-playing video game developed by 38 Studios and Big Huge Games. It features a high fantasy world, action-oriented combat, and extensive character customization. Players take on the role of the 'Fateless One,' a resurrected hero immune to destiny, tasked with stopping a plot to conquer the Faelands.

