    (description) Resident Evil 3: Remake is a survival horror game by Capcom, a reimagining of the 1999 original. It modernizes the game with updated graphics and controls, focusing on Jill Valentine's escape from Raccoon City while pursued by Nemesis. Praised for its action and visuals, it received some criticism for its shorter campaign and linearity.

